            HTML
        &lt;/h2&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;
            Learn how to structure web pages.
        &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section id="css"&gt;

        &lt;h2&gt;
            CSS
        &lt;/h2&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;
            Learn how to style web pages.
        &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;/section&gt;

    &lt;section id="javascript"&gt;

        &lt;h2&gt;
            JavaScript
        &lt;/h2&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;
            Learn how to add interactivity to web pages.
        &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;/section&gt;

&lt;/main&gt;</code></pre>

<div class="try-it-container">
    <button type="button"
